{"id":632,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教教育と幅広い学びで世界市民へ","feature_description":"関西学院中学部はキリスト教主義を教育の基礎に置き、礼拝や学校生活を通じて人間としてのあり方、感性、倫理性を考えます。中高10年間の一貫教育の中で幅広い教科学習を行い、行事・クラブ・奉仕活動を組み合わせて学びを広げます。世界市民として社会に関わる人を育てることを掲げ、知識・技能の習得と他者との協働を重視し、生徒の主体的な成長を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":11721,"name":"J.H.C.（宗教部）","category":"その他","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11722,"name":"聖歌隊","category":"その他","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14390,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14391,"name":"図書部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14392,"name":"グリークラブ（合唱部）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14393,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14394,"name":"理科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14395,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14396,"name":"陸上競技部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14397,"name":"水泳部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14398,"name":"サッカー部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14399,"name":"野球部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14400,"name":"テニス部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_